  else ([still Pending or Scheduled])
  endif
  if () then ([summary changed])
    :Refresh summary; require confirmation again;
  else ([summary unchanged])
|Database|
:Guarded atomic cancellation: recheck ownership,\nPending/Scheduled state and reviewed allocation;\nmark request Cancelled and release future\nallocation ONCE; keep parking unchanged;
